   "Id": "m0153:0x06003424",
   "ProposedName": "RestoreSettingsAfterLocalResetAsync",
   "Reason": "If a reset timestamp is pending, waits the elapsed milliseconds when elapsed is below one second (not the remaining interval), clears the timestamp, then unless initialization is suppressed reselects cEMI and writes/verifies PID_COMM_MODE 8/52. Uses CancellationToken.None. This records the existing delay behavior without correcting it.",
